      "statement": "All webapp backend calls go through lib/api.ts, which always sends credentials: 'include' (HTTP-only cookies, no frontend token handling) and an x-dalgo-org header from localStorage.selectedOrg, against NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL (default http://localhost:8002).",
