      "id": "claim_2dc097c701ac4e3593bf8f988a47a659",
      "statement": "apiFetch triggers token refresh on HTTP 498 (expired access token), not on 401: concurrent 498s share one POST /api/v2/token/refresh promise, the original request is retried once, and failure or a repeat 498 calls handleAuthFailure and throws; a 401 skips refresh and calls handleAuthFailure immediately.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://webapp/lib/api.ts#L98-L126",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:771f21f5cf1c3be5bc485e4c2b429471339ad91576525720bc569b7dfbd71371:"
        }
